{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "catalogVersion": "2026.10.26",
  "notes": [
    "Starter detection catalog for Rogue Agent Checker. Vendors move files around between releases: treat this as living content.",
    "Regex patterns are matched case-insensitively against NORMALIZED text: lowercase, backslashes converted to forward slashes.",
    "Path templates use forward slashes and these tokens, expanded per user profile: ~ (profile root), %APPDATA%, %LOCALAPPDATA%, %TEMP%. Machine tokens: %PROGRAMDATA%, %PROGRAMFILES%.",
    "First matching agent wins, so more specific entries (for example claude-code) must come before generic ones (claude-desktop)."
  ],

